    <string name="about_core_text">Ядро mihomo, tun2socks hev-socks5-tunnel. Поддержка VLESS + XHTTP + Reality, Hysteria2, TUIC, AnyTLS, Shadowsocks, Trojan, VMess, WireGuard.</string>
